<!-- Strings for the `double-pendulum` demo (registered by
     `DoublePendulumFragment.kt`). Android's resource merger
     fans every `res/values/*.xml` file in, so `R.string.demo_double_pendulum_title` etc.
     remains globally resolvable. Adding a new demo never needs to touch
     this file or `strings.xml` — see #1870. -->
